OL,3,GNEWSAPolice attacked by 'large group'
OL,4,Aof football fans in Stirling
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have appealed for information
OL,7,Fafter two officers were assaulted by a
OL,8,Flarge group of football supporters as
OL,9,Fthey made an arrest at Stirling railway
OL,10,Fstation.
OL,12,FThe incident, which happened early
OL,13,FSunday evening, involved fans
OL,14,Ftravelling to Edinburgh following
OL,15,FHibernian's match with St Johnstone in
OL,16,FPerth earlier that day.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
