OL,3,GNEWSAPolice attacked by 'large group'
OL,4,Aof football fans in Stirling
OL,5,
OL,6,FBritish Transport Police (BTP) said
OL,7,Fofficers were surrounded and assaulted
OL,8,Fby the group of supporters as they
OL,9,Fmoved to arrest a man who had been
OL,10,Fabusive to other officers on board the
OL,11,Ftrain from Perth.
OL,13,FThe supporters then left the scene and
OL,14,Fboarded a train to Edinburgh Park
OL,15,Frailway station.
